# The harness, analysed separately and far below the level src/ and tests/ get.
#
# An exercise reads an untyped API response on purpose - Response::data() hands
# back mixed, and that is the design rather than an oversight - so level 10 here
# produces pages of "cannot cast mixed to string" and nothing else. Fighting
# that would make the exercises worse to read for no gain.
#
# Level 0 still catches the one failure that actually bit: a class that does not
# exist. `$result instanceof Response` with the import missing is silently FALSE
# rather than an error, so a registration step quietly never ran and the
# exercise left real records behind in a live CRM. Nothing else in the toolchain
# was looking at harness/ at all.
parameters:
    level: 0

    paths:
        - harness
